description.narrative:
The overall objective is to contribute to a Libyan-led, effective, transparent and accountable implementation, monitoring and management of the security and stabilisation arrangements stemming from the Berlin Conferences (January 2020, June 2021), the subsequent Agreement for a Complete and Permanent Ceasefire in Libya (October 2020) and UN Security Council resolution 2570 (2021). 
UNOPS support includes: 
- Travel and logistic support for trainings/ workshops/ meetings;
- Procurement of non-lethal, non-military equipment/ services according to UNOPS rules and regulations;
- Human resources support for the recruitment and contracting of technical expertise that is necessary to deliver on the agreed outputs.
